        "mission_intent": "Subject: Post-Incident Follow-Up Report Process and Lessons Learned Documentation\n\nTeam, following the recent wave of phishing-related incidents we handled last quarter, I need us to formalize our post-incident reporting and lessons learned process in line with our NIST 800-61 obligations. Specifically, I'm asking the SOC leads to develop a standardized follow-up report template that each incident handler must complete after case closure. The template should capture how the incident was handled end-to-end, document major points of agreement from any debrief meetings, and record action items assigned to responsible parties. We also need a mechanism to communicate findings to stakeholders who were unable to attend the post-mortem sessions. The reports should be structured so they're usable as training material for onboarding new analysts, showing real-world response decision-making from experienced team members. Additionally, any procedural gaps or inaccuracies identified during post-mortem analysis must be flagged and routed to the policy team for updates to our incident response playbooks. Please have the draft template and process workflow ready for review by end of next week. Let me know if there are resource constraints.",
